 {
  "id": "D1",
  "kind": "entity",
  "role": "declaration",
  "statement": "The canonical artifact is program.vscore.json with one typed entry solve of arity 1. Its input represents {events:[{group:string,time:int,value:int|null}],start:int,end:int,width:positive int,fill:'none'|'previous'} and its result represents [{group:string,start:int,count:natural,value:int|null}] under the data-pipeline/0.3 serialization profile. Integers are unbounded mathematical integers; strings are sequences of Unicode scalar values ordered lexicographically by scalar codepoint.",
  "required": true,
  "dependencies": [],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
   "The declared input and result preserve all specified fields and their domains.",
   "Canonical source uses vscore/0.3 under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3.",
   "Define G as the scalar-codepoint-lexicographically sorted unique group names of all input events.",
   "Define B as the increasing sequence b_k=start+k*width for natural k with b_k<end.",
   "For g in G and k indexing B, define M(g,k) as the list of event occurrences with group=g, b_k<=time<min(b_k+width,end), and value non-null; define c(g,k)=length M(g,k) and s(g,k)=the mathematical integer sum of those values."
  ],
  "blocked_by": []
 },
 {
  "id": "A1",
  "kind": "precondition",
  "role": "assumption",
